  "body": "Our vendor is overseas, has no plans to return, and this property must be sold. With expectations well below CV, here's an opportunity to buy into a sought-after North Shore neighbourhood at a price that will surprise you.\r\n\r\nTucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac, this is the kind of location families buy into and stay. Where school runs can be done on foot, everyday essentials are just around the corner, and coming home means leaving the hustle and bustle behind.\r\n\r\nA spacious backyard made for the good stuff. Kids playing. Pets roaming. Long summer afternoons outside. Room to grow, room to play, and the freedom to create your own outdoor sanctuary.\r\n\r\nEnjoy it as it is. Make it your own over time. There's something particularly exciting about buying well in a great location, with the freedom to shape what comes next. First home, smart investment or simply an opportunity too good to pass up. Whatever your next chapter looks like, this could be where it starts.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closing 5pm, Wednesday 9th December 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD: rwmilford.co.nz/MFD30513 (scroll down to documents)\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n\r\n-1/2 share of 2,196sqm (more or less) with a generous, private exclusive-use area\r\n-1980s weathboard and block construction\r\n-Three bedrooms, one bathroom\r\n-Quiet cul-de-sac position\r\n-Spacious backyard for kids and pets to play\r\n-Comfortable, functional living\r\n-Separate laundry\r\n-Garage plus plenty of off-street parking\r\n-Scope to personalise and add value\r\n-Walk-everywhere convenience\r\n-Zoned for Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate & Long Bay College\r\n\r\nGreat location. Genuine opportunity. Absolute motivation.\r\n\r\nForget the CV. This property must be sold, and someone is going to be very glad they paid attention.\r\n\r\nWelcome home.",
